Forge loads libforge_expr dynamically from Contents/Frameworks/libforge_expr.dylib.
You may replace that file with your own build of the library. The changes made to
FreeCAD's code, and their dates, are listed in MODIFICATIONS.md. The complete
corresponding source code of libforge_expr, including those modifications and the
scripts that build it, is made available alongside the Forge release that contains
this notice.
